Strips whitespace and splits the line by the pipe character (|).

If the line doesn't have exactly 3 components, raise a custom ValueError("Malformed log entry").

Returns a dictionary containing {"timestamp": ..., "severity": ..., "message": ...} with severity converted to uppercase.
